    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulakusi khuMoabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abe mushilaamo shiobubii oukhola emilimo ChiOMWAMI niyeetembeekha; khandi abe mushilaamo shiobubii owikalila olukangalwe oburaraatsia amatsayi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, lole, tsindaalo tsili okhwitsa, OMWAMI aboola, olwa ndalamurumila abachetululi, nabo balamuchetulula; balatsukha akomundenjekhotsie tsitong'e tsikhaya, nibaaraka tsisiongotsie ebitonye ebitonye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Moabu alafwimbilwa Khemoshi omurwe, shinga abeinzu yaIsiraeli olwa bafwimbiilwe Beteli omurwe, elia beesiikanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshiina shiulile khushialo shiomuhololookhwe mbu khuEloloni, nokhuYaza, nokhuMefaatsi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuDiboni, nokhuNebo nokhuBetsi-dibilatsaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuKiriatsaimu, nokhuBetsi gamuli, nokhuBetsi meoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuKeriotsi nokhuBozora, nokhumataala kosi keshialo shiaMoabu, akehale nakahambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwika lwaMoabu lukhalaakwe, omukhonokwe nakwo kufiniishe; nilwo olwa OMWAMI aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumumeesie, okhuba yeekhulumamia nafukula OMWAMI; mana Moabu alakalakala mumasasike, naye yesi nanyokhoosibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba iwe shiwanyokhoosia Isiraeli? Yanyoolekhanga nali mubeebi, okhuchila noyuyilanga omurwe buli lwosi olwa wamuralakhwo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heshiboni naEleale bakhupa tsimbungu; emioyo chiabwe chihuliilikha eYahazi, okhurula khuZoari okhuula khuHoronaimu naEgelatsi shelishiya; okhuba kata amatsi kaNimurimu kakwile eshitsiimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi, OMWAMI aboola, ndalaakamia muMoabu oyo oumalila emisango habundu aheechingu, nende oyo ousambila abanyasayebe amalesi kelibuuliesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila omwoyo kwanje nikulilila Moabu shinga amalele; omwoyo kwanje kulila shinga amalele khulwa abeKiriheresi; ne niko akachila emiandu echia banyoola nichisishile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba buli murwe kubechilwe, khandi buli shileefu shirio; amakhono kosi kalikhwo tsisalache, khandi tsingubo tsiamakunia tsili mushishienje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khubilama bietsinzu tsieMoabu, nokhunjilatsie tsiosi, khulikhwo okhwikhuula hosi hosi; okhuba ndaarile Moabu shinga inyungu eyirachamisia ta, OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makowe, alikuluulwe! Makowe, bakhupa tsimbungu! Makowe, Moabu akhupile amashemo khulwa tsisoni! Nolwa Moabu akwile eshiokhunyokhoosibwa nokhuriisia khubosi abamubotokhana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
